WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:08.722
Once, a group of frogs lived in a little pond.

2
00:00:08.723 --> 00:00:10.959
They lived there happily.

3
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.444
"Let's have a jumping contest.

4
00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:16.361
I bet I can jump the highest."

5
00:00:16.362 --> 00:00:20.738
"You always want to show off. Go ahead.

6
00:00:20.739 --> 00:00:23.808
Show us how high you can jump."

7
00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:26.981
Frog Al knew how to jump the highest.

8
00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:30.409
He had learned how to bounce off a seaweed pod.

9
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.503
This made him jump very high.

10
00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:37.993
"Wow! How does he jump so high?"

11
00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:44.880
All the other frogs wanted to jump high, but they could not jump higher than Frog Al did.

12
00:00:44.881 --> 00:00:47.412
Frog Al was very proud.

13
00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:51.041
"See, I am better than everyone else.

14
00:00:51.042 --> 00:00:54.025
I am the greatest jumper."

15
00:00:54.026 --> 00:00:58.012
"I am sure that there is someone who is better than you.

16
00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:01.712
Everyone has at least one weakness."

17
00:01:01.713 --> 00:01:04.079
"Yeah, like diving.

18
00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.172
I am sure one of us can dive further than you."

19
00:01:08.173 --> 00:01:11.370
"Oh yeah? Okay then.

20
00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:14.752
Let's have a diving contest!"

21
00:01:14.753 --> 00:01:19.147
All the frogs lined up on the edge of a rock to dive.

22
00:01:19.148 --> 00:01:26.745
"Ready, set, dive!"

23
00:01:26.746 --> 00:01:32.184
When the other frogs jumped in, Al sank furthest to the bottom.

24
00:01:32.185 --> 00:01:35.137
"See, I told you.

25
00:01:35.138 --> 00:01:38.231
I am better than everyone else.

26
00:01:38.232 --> 00:01:42.263
I am the greatest. Ha-ha-ha!"

27
00:01:42.264 --> 00:01:47.514
"Well, maybe you are, but you should not boast so much."

28
00:01:47.515 --> 00:01:51.168
"Right. Al, you boast too much."

29
00:01:51.169 --> 00:01:54.905
One day the frogs were enjoying the sun.

30
00:01:54.906 --> 00:01:58.258
A big ox came to drink at the pond.

31
00:01:58.259 --> 00:02:01.410
"Hey! Let's get out of here quickly.

32
00:02:01.411 --> 00:02:03.686
There's a huge beast coming!"

33
00:02:03.687 --> 00:02:07.266
"Yeah! Let's hide until he leaves."

34
00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:11.503
But soon they found that the ox was harmless.

35
00:02:11.504 --> 00:02:14.198
"He is only drinking the water."

36
00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:17.811
So they all came out to admire him.

37
00:02:17.812 --> 00:02:21.050
"Look how huge the beast is!"

38
00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:26.138
"Yeah, it would take hundreds of us to make one of him!"

39
00:02:26.139 --> 00:02:29.247
"Huh! He's not so big.

40
00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:33.580
I can be as big as he is. Just watch!"

41
00:02:33.581 --> 00:02:38.707
Frog Al drew in a deep breath and puffed his belly out.

42
00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:47.644
"Ha-ha! You're very little, far too little! Ha-ha!"

43
00:02:47.645 --> 00:02:52.157
"Ha-ha! You are not even bigger than his foot!"

44
00:02:52.158 --> 00:02:56.264
"Not bigger? I can be as big as he is.

45
00:02:56.265 --> 00:03:00.671
Just watch! Is this big enough?"

46
00:03:00.672 --> 00:03:05.604
"You're very little, still too little!"

47
00:03:05.605 --> 00:03:09.779
"Too little? I can be as big as he is.

48
00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.525
How about this?

49
00:03:11.526 --> 00:03:14.300
Is this big enough?"

50
00:03:14.301 --> 00:03:18.977
"You're very little, far too little!

51
00:03:18.978 --> 00:03:22.003
Still not big enough!"

52
00:03:22.004 --> 00:03:25.018
"What? Still not big enough?

53
00:03:25.019 --> 00:03:27.626
I can be as big as he is.

54
00:03:27.627 --> 00:03:31.229
Just watch! How about this?

55
00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.241
Is this big enough now?"

56
00:03:34.242 --> 00:03:38.117
"No, still not nearly big enough.

57
00:03:38.118 --> 00:03:40.511
Now, you had better stop.

58
00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:42.970
You might burst your belly!"

59
00:03:42.971 --> 00:03:47.151
The ox was watching the frog getting bigger and bigger.

60
00:03:47.152 --> 00:03:50.086
He thought it was very funny.

61
00:03:50.087 --> 00:03:57.669
Out of curiosity he stepped on the strange frog to see what would happen. Pop!

62
00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.679
"Oh my! What a pity!

63
00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:05.188
His boasting cost him his life after all."

64
00:04:05.189 --> 00:04:10.168
Then the frogs hopped sadly away.
